        Which role is primarily responsible?
      </p>

      <div style={{
        padding: 16,
        background: '#161b22',
        border: '1px solid #30363d',
        borderRadius: 8,
        marginBottom: 12
      }}>
        <strong>{scenario.task}</strong>
      </div>

      {revealed && (
        <div style={{
          padding: 12,
          background: '#161b22',
          borderRadius: 8,
          marginBottom: 12
        }}>
          <strong>{scenario.answer}</strong>
          <p style={{ color: '#8b949e', marginBottom: 0 }}>
            {scenario.explanation}
